message: "If you use this dataset or code, please cite it as below."
title: "Multi-objective supplier selection for rare-earth-oxide production — dataset and code"
abstract: >-
  Open dataset (13 inputs x 500 candidate suppliers) and reproducible code for the
  bi-objective (cost vs. Global Warming Potential) supplier-selection problem for
  rare-earth-oxide production, in both an unconstrained (separable) and a
  consolidation-constrained (NP-hard, p-median) regime. Includes a benchmark of
  metaheuristic, multi-criteria and exact techniques against the exact Pareto front,
  plus multi-child differential evolution (MO-MCDE, MO-MC-SHADE) and Bayesian
  algorithm configuration (MO-SMAC) adapted to the multi-objective setting.
type: dataset
